 carve tunnels and chambers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine and sell: extract valuable minerals and sell them to earn money for upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drill for oil and refine fuel: drill into oil pockets and refine it into fuel to keep your operation running.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique items: find rare one off collectibles such as fossils, treasures, and other unusual artifacts hidden in the ground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your rig: improve drilling, speed, efficiency and others so you can reach deeper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight to keep going: the deeper you go, the more demons and other threats you will face.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GOAL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the mission  and come out the other side in China.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316220/extras/29556bc303de86db82a946a1b991bfc3.poster.avif?t=1785929125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316220/extras/29556bc303de86db82a946a1b991bfc3.webm?t=1785929125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316220/extras/29556bc303de86db82a946a1b991bfc3.mp4?t=1785929125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316220/extras/d66f36cef35ca4d3bd1d91b433150ed0.poster.avif?t=1785929125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316220/extras/d66f36cef35ca4d3bd1d91b433150ed0.webm?t=1785929125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets